{
  "uid": "model-quality",
  "title": "Model quality and escalations",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "tags": [
    "agent-platform",
    "pedagogical"
  ],
  "editable": false,
  "timezone": "browser",
  "refresh": "15s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Evaluación pendiente",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Los tokens y la velocidad no miden calidad. La demo y el bugfix fueron aceptados mediante tests externos; el bugfix requirió intervención humana. Falta emitir resultados evaluados, intentos y escalaciones. No hay porcentajes de éxito automáticos todavía."
      },
      "id": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Errores técnicos del proxy",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(agent_calls_total{service_name=\"litellm-proxy\",status_code=\"STATUS_CODE_ERROR\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service_name}} {{span_name}} {{gen_ai_token_type}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "id": 2
    }
  ],
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Vista general de la plataforma",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/d/platform-overview",
      "keepTime": true,
      "targetBlank": false
    }
  ]
